  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [autoprefixer](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer) from `v7.2.1` to `v7.2.6`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v7.2.2`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;722)\n\n* Fix `_autoprefixerDisabled is undefined` issue.\n\n---\n\n### [`v7.2.3`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;723)\n\n* Fix `grid-template-areas` in `@media` (by Evgeny Petukhov).\n\n---\n\n### [`v7.2.4`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;724)\n\n* Fix IE 10 support.\n\n---\n\n### [`v7.2.5`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;725)\n\n* Fix multiple prefixes in declaration value.\n\n---\n\n### [`v7.2.6`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;726)\n\n* Fix `-ms-` prefix for grid cells with same `grid-area` (by Evgeny Petukhov).\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v7.2.2\n-   [`462f05c`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/462f05c2b861df5d03077782c54c7f532beb619c) Reduce size &amp; make animation check a little faster (#&#8203;949)\n-   [`0072163`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/00721633f4900c9c2d2e006a4dd3d29828e8993f) Fix strange issue by stacktrace\n-   [`93e12e8`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/93e12e87f04c25232cda6fa4e01a157c0016dc6e) Update dependencies\n-   [`fe8ec43`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/fe8ec43906667f1eba201e73e36c11106e691820) Fix Size Limit warning\n-   [`c8a69e2`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/c8a69e2669178c38aa255bc6d792c6bcf5e46444) Release 7.2.2 version\n#### v7.2.3\n-   [`c762f4b`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/c762f4bbc1a86aadd5dd0bbb18571976493f91dc)  Fix #&#8203;954  (#&#8203;955)\n-   [`0550db0`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/0550db0a9a4d024c78ac16fe80f2a80f789975cf) Fix test\n-   [`361ca8c`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/361ca8cb3c1921554cc598d9080acd9dbd5b5517) Update dependencies\n-   [`7af5965`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/7af5965d3a17fece4a73544ae15bb13276b24bd5) Release 7.2.3 version\n#### v7.2.4\n-   [`9c52095`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/9c52095150b365c1538c77de98e02c2bdced9913) More clear disabling docs\n-   [`fe3c73d`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/fe3c73dabb9659e1655a0a821a2b45f32a60b3d1) Add IE 10 support to build\n-   [`67c1008`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/67c1008620c3ee4821ecb3e9a63e41dda34902b4) Remove unnecessary dependency\n-   [`868c765`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/868c765f8d93a258d4acecdf036a49f00f673e1d) Update dependencies\n-   [`555f957`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/555f957340373456c9911370ea7e6ea7e7f62d7d) Update AUTHORS\n-   [`b37588f`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/b37588f21e7ee619bde019b58278194d6f0296b8) Use Jest 22\n-   [`2b4a829`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/2b4a829e3c866d18c1f618eb543bd2c8012c41e7) Remove unnecessary browserlist config from package.json\n-   [`f75818a`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/f75818a288b6b77045af608420a136b1b7fb5de6) Delete development sections from build package.json\n-   [`3e47707`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/3e477074575f45f70e440936e3d5cad0bb052344) Fix for IE 9/10 in class which use extends (#&#8203;963)\n-   [`b3e6129`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/b3e61296939bd92179efa93085d27697742504fb) Update PostCSS\n-   [`588f910`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/588f910ee092da9df6f2e9b17da81472900e7c4a) Update Browserslist\n-   [`d641594`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/d6415945f8a7ee1ef11be0a87d61ef6a5a6c6cea) Release 7.2.4 version\n#### v7.2.5\n-   [`e7d0fd3`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/e7d0fd3d9aff0142a7dbd0ea2be4c7c3a8ec324c) Update dependencies\n-   [`ecd7eed`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/ecd7eed7d9a66bac493d7dbfa58617908ec09f74) Fix value prefixing\n-   [`f37e5ba`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/f37e5ba9cff5c2d4429306b3f0562f130c7b6d6c) Release 7.2.5 version\n#### v7.2.6\n-   [`5d94aec`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/5d94aecd81e1c507406179dd90548d03c69f2617) Add missing space in `autoprefixer -info` CLI docs (#&#8203;978)\n-   [`312dfff`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/312dfffbf88be77e253af46f8872b05844b988d6) Don&#x27;t require sub-files in postcss (#&#8203;981)\n-   [`15a54ab`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/15a54ab974a45f1ba07c208e702c35422172899c) Fix Browserslist config name\n-   [`aaecf3b`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/aaecf3bd0370c56a8263422606dda8ec9d204004) [grid-template-areas] Repetitive grid-area declarations (#&#8203;983)\n-   [`ba05148`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/ba05148ffad4a4af3ddb5e3d2cd6a9e6a0175f3c) Update dependencies\n-   [`e1feb33`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/e1feb331f7ec5f022de4cdf2127202c4c90e4c1c) Release 7.2.6 version\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
